                <mxCell id="q_i1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;Posterior ∝ prior × likelihood&lt;/b&gt;: start from what you believed, multiply by how well each possibility fits the data, then rescale to 100%." vertex="1">
